[0.392, "o", "\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[35m                           Welcome To Merentha\r\r\n \r\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[31m\"...A cold wind blows over the new day.  A lone newbie awakens on the dew\r\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[31m    soaken grasses, her world in shambles.  The earth had stopped shaking\r\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[31m    and the fire had ceased falling from the skies.  Her town of Cabeiri\r\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[31m    burning in flames, and her not knowing if there were any survivors.\r\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[31m    This land she awoke to, is the new Merentha...\"\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[37m            Driver: fluffos v2026.08.20    Mudlib: Merentha/NM MM-2.1           \r\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[37m        <<<  Visit the Merentha web page at http://www.merentha.com  >>>        \r\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[37m                   There are currently 13 adventurers playing                   \r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[0;37;40m\u001b[32mWhat name do you wish?\u001b[0;37;40m "]
